# RAW Official — environment variables.
#
# ⚠️ NAMES ONLY. NEVER PUT A REAL VALUE IN THIS FILE. It is committed to the
# repository, so anything written here is published.
#
# ⚠️ AND THIS SITE NEEDS NONE OF THEM TO BUILD. `npm run build` succeeds with
# no environment set at all, and produces static files. That is deliberate:
# DEFROST.WORLD builds this repository with nothing configured.
#
# This file previously declared GEMINI_API_KEY as "Required for Gemini AI API
# calls" and APP_URL as injected by AI Studio. Neither was true any more — the
# AI features were removed from this site entirely, and nothing in the code
# reads either name. A stale "required" key is how a key ends up being created,
# pasted somewhere, and leaked for a feature that does not exist.

# PORT: which port the Express server listens on. Optional; defaults to 3000.
# Used only by `npm run start`. Not needed for the static build.
PORT=""
